+/*  a <marker> drawing the arrowhead @shape of @e as the model does
+ *  (chopgimp-vobject.c, draw_arrow: tip on the end of the path, length
+ *  L = 4 × width × scale, width L; a « triangle », « square », « bar »,
+ *  « circle » filled, an « arrow » stroked with the width of the stroke)
+ *  in the color of the stroke; → its id
